# YAKMESH NETWORK ENGINE LICENSE AGREEMENT VERSION 1.0

## Plain English Preface

In plain English, this license agreement is a modified version of the
MPL 2.0 license under which PeerQuanta provides an "open source"
version of the software that underpins the YakMesh network. This
license is intended to convey to you the right to modify the source
code of the YakMesh network engine in order to make improvements to the
performance or behavior of the YakMesh network, or improvements to the
tools, clients and other supporting software that work with the
YakMesh network.  No other use or modification of the code is
permitted.  Within this narrow field of use, the community may do with
the software as it sees fit and without oversight or approval by
PeerQuanta.  However, please understand that the below license does not
allow you to create new competing mesh networks or other standalone
projects with our software, nor does it allow you to use or modify any
of PeerQuanta's software in order to make it compatible with any other
networking, identity, or distributed-systems projects.  Finally, this
license contains a mandatory grant back to PeerQuanta to any
modifications or improvements you might make.  Please consider that
carefully before contributing your work to the YakMesh project.

This license is derived from the Mochimo Cryptocurrency Engine License
Agreement v1.0 (itself a modified MPL 2.0), used with the permission of
Adequate Systems, LLC.

